  "goodToKnow": "Die Rezension is a review of a book, film, concert or product: eine positive Rezension. Der Rezensent is the reviewer, and rezensieren means to review. Online, product reviews are usually called Bewertungen. Germany's most famous literary critic was Marcel Reich-Ranicki of TV's Das Literarische Quartett. Don't confuse it with die Rezession (recession) or die Revision (audit, legal appeal)."
